From 8b9126c995558885a2ffd1e922bde12002a6a595 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:46:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] fix: traverse SOAP request elements without suffix
 underflow

Match local names without subtracting unchecked lengths and advance
through every sibling. Keep searches within their requested subtree,
reject malformed envelopes and DTD input, and verify the operation
namespace against its service endpoint. Terminate the CGI input buffer.

Fixes: d2f362bdb0dc ("Add new functions to ezxml_wrapper")
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
